Termux terminal-emulator
-----------------------
The Java terminal-emulator sources in app/src/main/java/com/aos/agent/terminal/
are adapted from termux/termux-app, tag v0.118.1, terminal-emulator module.
Upstream source: https://github.com/termux/termux-app/tree/v0.118.1/terminal-emulator
License statement: https://github.com/termux/termux-app/blob/v0.118.1/LICENSE.md

That upstream statement identifies the terminal-emulator and terminal-view
libraries as Apache License 2.0 exceptions to the repository's GPLv3-only
license. The terminal emulator derives from Terminal Emulator for Android:
https://github.com/jackpal/Android-Terminal-Emulator
Copyright (c) 2005-2008, The Android Open Source Project
See licenses/android-terminal-emulator-NOTICE.txt and LICENSE.

Local adaptations include the com.aos.agent.terminal package, the pty native
library binding, and app-specific session integration. TerminalViewModel.kt
and app/src/main/cpp/pty.c provide the AOS-Agent integration.

